  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Retreat to Santa Rosa Beach, Florida and stay in Happy as a Clam, a well-appointed 30A vacation home perfect for a group getaway. With three bedrooms and three full bathrooms, this rental can comfortably accommodate 12 guests. On top of the spacious arrangements, it also features a private pool and includes four adult bikes to utilize so you can cruise through the community!<br><br>This home towers two stories high giving each member of your group plenty of space to unpack and unwind. Upon arrival, you will be greeted by a spacious floorplan including a fully equipped kitchen and living room. The kitchen comes stocked with all the utensils and equipment you may need to whip up snacks for the beach. After your day in the sun, relax in the living room watching your favorite shows and movies on the Smart TV provided. Or, you might want to step outside and enjoy the gorgeous Florida weather on your private patio. Either way, Happy as a Clam is the perfect spot for relaxation and some fun in the sun.<br><br>Speaking of fun in the sun, the beach is just a short walk away! On the days you are hoping to stay close to home, take advantage of your private pool right in the backyard. Your kids will love the endless hours spent splashing around in the pool. The outdoor shower is sure to come in handy to wash away the day before heading inside. Not to mention, there is a private gas grill available for guests. This provides the perfect opportunity to spend one night in chowing down on some hamburgers and hotdogs!<br><br>30A is known for having tons of delicious dining and exciting adventure. Stop by one of the beachfront restaurants for happy hour or travel to a different 30A community and experience a change in scenery. Walton Dunes Beach access is only a quick walk away and features sugar-white sand and crystal clear waters.<br><br>Reserve your stay at Happy as a Clam today!<br><br>Nearest Beach Access: Walton Dunes Public Access<br><br>Clean Coverlet Program: This property provides fresh and clean bed linens, including comforters and coverlets, laundered prior to every check-in.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Happy as a Clam | Luxe Coastal Home, Near Beach with Pool and 4 Bikes"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
